<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>1:1 &amp; Small Group Coaching — The Bowling Lab</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Personal fast bowling coaching sessions for individual players and small groups across Melbourne's eastern suburbs. Outdoor and indoor options available." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon.svg" />
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="nav" id="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">
        <span class="logo-the">THE</span>
        <span class="logo-main">BOWLING LAB</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="index.html#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="index.html#pricing">Club pricing</a>
        <a href="index.html#about">About</a>
        <a href="coaching.html" class="nav-active">1:1 Coaching</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Book a session</a>
      </div>
      <button class="nav-burger" id="navBurger" aria-label="Open menu">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-mobile" id="navMobile">
      <a href="index.html#how" onclick="closeMobile()">How it works</a>
      <a href="index.html#pricing" onclick="closeMobile()">Club pricing</a>
      <a href="index.html#about" onclick="closeMobile()">About</a>
      <a href="coaching.html" onclick="closeMobile()">1:1 Coaching</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="mobile-cta" onclick="closeMobile()">Book a session</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="coaching-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Personal coaching · Melbourne East</p>
      <h1 class="coaching-h1">1:1 &amp; Small Group<br>Fast Bowling Coaching.</h1>
      <p class="coaching-hero-sub">Individual sessions for players who want focused, specialist feedback on their action, plans and game awareness. Outdoor and indoor options available across Melbourne's eastern suburbs.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Book a session</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT'S COVERED -->
  <section class="coaching-covered">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="coaching-covered-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">What's covered</p>
          <h2 class="section-h2">The same specialist focus, built around you.</h2>
          <p class="coaching-body">These sessions cover the same core areas as the club program — technical assessment, bowling plans, reading batters and game awareness — but with the full hour focused entirely on you and your game.</p>
          <p class="coaching-body">No write-up after the session. Just focused, practical coaching in real time with specific things to take away and work on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="coaching-list">
          <div class="coaching-item">
            <span class="inc-num">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Technical assessment</h3>
              <p>Analysis of your action with practical, immediate feedback.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="coaching-item">
            <span class="inc-num">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Bowling plans</h3>
              <p>Building plans for different batters and match situations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="coaching-item">
            <span class="inc-num">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Reading batters</h3>
              <p>What to look for and how to adjust your plans mid-spell.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="coaching-item">
            <span class="inc-num">04</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Game awareness</h3>
              <p>Building pressure, owning a spell, knowing your best ball under pressure.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section class="coaching-pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Pricing</p>
      <h2 class="section-h2">Outdoor and indoor options.</h2>

      <div class="cp-grid">

        <!-- OUTDOOR -->
        <div class="cp-block">
          <div class="cp-block-header">
            <h3>Outdoor</h3>
            <p>Bring your own ground — park, oval, or any outdoor facility. No net hire costs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-rows">
            <div class="cp-row">
              <span class="cp-label">1 player</span>
              <span class="cp-price">$90</span>
              <span class="cp-note">60 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-row">
              <span class="cp-label">2 players</span>
              <span class="cp-price">$130</span>
              <span class="cp-note">~$65 per player</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-row">
              <span class="cp-label">3 players</span>
              <span class="cp-price">$160</span>
              <span class="cp-note">~$53 per player</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- INDOOR -->
        <div class="cp-block cp-block--featured">
          <div class="cp-block-header">
            <h3>Indoor</h3>
            <p>Net hire included in the price. No extra costs, nothing to organise.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-rows">
            <div class="cp-row">
              <span class="cp-label">1 player</span>
              <span class="cp-price">$110</span>
              <span class="cp-note">60 min · nets included</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-row">
              <span class="cp-label">2 players</span>
              <span class="cp-price">$150</span>
              <span class="cp-note">~$75 per player</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-row">
              <span class="cp-label">3 players</span>
              <span class="cp-price">$180</span>
              <span class="cp-note">~$60 per player</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
      <p class="pricing-note">Maximum 3 players per small group session. Eastern suburbs of Melbourne only.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
  <section class="coaching-who">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label light">Who it's for</p>
      <h2 class="who-h2">Any fast bowler who wants more than a group session can give them.</h2>
      <div class="who-tags">
        <span class="tag">Junior players</span>
        <span class="tag">Senior club players</span>
        <span class="tag">1st &amp; 2nd XI bowlers</span>
        <span class="tag">Emerging quicks</span>
        <span class="tag">Academy program bowlers</span>
        <span class="tag">Mates splitting a session</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-text">
          <p class="section-label light">Book a session</p>
          <h2 class="contact-h2">Lock in a session.</h2>
          <p class="contact-sub">Get in touch and we'll sort out a time, location and format that works for you. Outdoor or indoor, 1:1 or a small group — happy to make it work.</p>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <a href="mailto:Josh@thebowlinglab.com.au">Josh@thebowlinglab.com.au</a>
            <a href="tel:0418372933">0418 372 933</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-urgency">
            <span class="urgency-dot"></span>
            <span>Eastern suburbs of Melbourne only</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Josh Smith" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="0400 000 000" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="players">Number of players</label>
              <select id="players" name="players">
                <option value="">Select...</option>
                <option value="1">1 player (1:1)</option>
                <option value="2">2 players</option>
                <option value="3">3 players</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="format">Session type</label>
            <select id="format" name="format">
              <option value="">Select...</option>
              <option value="outdoor">Outdoor — no nets</option>
              <option value="indoor">Indoor — nets included</option>
              <option value="unsure">Not sure yet</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Anything else</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Tell me a bit about your game, what you're working on, preferred days, etc."></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary btn-full">Send enquiry</button>
          <p class="form-success" id="formSuccess" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-top">
        <div class="footer-logo">
          <span class="logo-the">THE</span>
          <span class="logo-main">BOWLING LAB</span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-nav">
          <a href="index.html#how">How it works</a>
          <a href="index.html#pricing">Club pricing</a>
          <a href="index.html#about">About</a>
          <a href="coaching.html">1:1 Coaching</a>
          <a href="#contact">Book</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>Small-group specialist coaching for fast bowlers · Eastern suburbs of Melbourne</p>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="mailto:Josh@thebowlinglab.com.au">Josh@thebowlinglab.com.au</a>
          <a href="tel:0418372933">0418 372 933</a>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/the.bowlinglab" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64">
  <!-- Background circle -->
  <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="32" fill="#6B1A2A"/>
  <!-- Three stumps -->
  <rect x="18" y="16" width="6" height="30" rx="1.5" fill="#F5F0E8"/>
  <rect x="29" y="16" width="6" height="30" rx="1.5" fill="#F5F0E8"/>
  <rect x="40" y="16" width="6" height="30" rx="1.5" fill="#F5F0E8"/>
  <!-- Bail left - breaking away -->
  <rect x="16" y="13" width="12" height="4" rx="1" fill="#A8C8E0" transform="rotate(-18 22 15)"/>
  <!-- Bail right - breaking away -->
  <rect x="36" y="13" width="12" height="4" rx="1" fill="#A8C8E0" transform="rotate(18 42 15)"/>
</svg>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>The Bowling Lab — Specialist Fast Bowling Coaching, Melbourne East</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Specialist pre-season fast bowling coaching for cricket clubs across Melbourne's eastern suburbs. Small groups, real-time coaching, delivered inside your existing program." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon.svg" />
  <!-- Open Graph -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="The Bowling Lab — Specialist Fast Bowling Coaching" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Pre-season fast bowling coaching for cricket clubs across Melbourne's eastern suburbs. Small groups, real-time, inside your existing program." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.thebowlinglab.com.au/og-image.jpg" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.thebowlinglab.com.au" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
</head>
<body>

  <!-- URGENCY BANNER -->
  <div class="urgency-bar">
    <span>Pre-season 2026/27 — only a handful of club bookings remaining across Melbourne's eastern suburbs.</span>
    <a href="#contact">Enquire now &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="nav" id="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
        <span class="logo-the">THE</span>
        <span class="logo-main">BOWLING LAB</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="coaching.html">1:1 Coaching</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Book a session</a>
      </div>
      <button class="nav-burger" id="navBurger" aria-label="Open menu">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-mobile" id="navMobile">
      <a href="#how" onclick="closeMobile()">How it works</a>
      <a href="#pricing" onclick="closeMobile()">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#about" onclick="closeMobile()">About</a>
      <a href="coaching.html" onclick="closeMobile()">1:1 Coaching</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="mobile-cta" onclick="closeMobile()">Book a session</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-graphic" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-fbc">FBC</div>
      <div class="hero-stumps" id="heroStumps">
        <div class="stump s1" id="hs1"></div>
        <div class="stump s2" id="hs2">
          <span class="stump-text">THE BOWLING LAB</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stump s3" id="hs3"></div>
        <div class="bail b1" id="hb1"></div>
        <div class="bail b2" id="hb2"></div>
        <div class="hero-ball" id="heroBall"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-slash"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-inner container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Melbourne East · Pre-Season 2026/27</p>
      <h1 class="hero-h1">
        <span class="h1-line">Set your</span>
        <span class="h1-line h1-accent">bowlers up</span>
        <span class="h1-line">for success.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Specialist fast bowling coaching delivered inside your existing pre-season program. No extra nights. No disruption.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Book a session</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Scroll</span>
      <div class="scroll-line"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF BAR -->
  <div class="proof-bar">
    <div class="proof-inner container">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">4–6</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Bowlers per session</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-div"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">60</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Minutes</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-div"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">0</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Extra training nights</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-div"></div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">70%</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Head coaching win rate</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="how" id="how">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="how-grid">
        <div class="how-text">
          <p class="section-label">What is The Bowling Lab</p>
          <h2 class="section-h2">Your fast bowlers deserve more than just nets.</h2>
          <p class="how-body">They need someone who can give them a plan, show them how to read a batter, and send them into round one knowing exactly what to do with the ball.</p>
          <p class="how-body">The Bowling Lab slots into your existing indoor sessions and works with your fast bowlers in real time. No extra night to schedule. No disruption to your program. Coaches get a written summary after every session to keep reinforcing the work through pre-season.</p>
          <p class="how-body how-origin">When I was coaching at Wonga Park, I always wanted to bring someone in specifically for the fast bowlers. A different voice, with different ideas. Someone who might say the same thing a different way and have it actually land. I couldn't find it, so I built it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-included">
          <p class="section-label">What's included</p>
          <div class="included-list">
            <div class="included-item">
              <span class="inc-num">01</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Technical assessment</h3>
                <p>Individual analysis of each bowler's action with practical feedback they can apply straight away.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="included-item">
              <span class="inc-num">02</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Bowling plans</h3>
                <p>How to set up a batter, build pressure, and create wicket-taking opportunities during a spell.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="included-item">
              <span class="inc-num">03</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Reading batters</h3>
                <p>Adjusting plans mid-spell based on what the batter is showing you.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="included-item">
              <span class="inc-num">04</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Game awareness</h3>
                <p>Building pressure, setting fields, owning a spell. The mental side of fast bowling.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="included-item">
              <span class="inc-num">05</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Individual feedback</h3>
                <p>Every bowler leaves with specific things to work on, tailored to their level and style.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="included-item">
              <span class="inc-num">06</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Written summary for coaches</h3>
                <p>A full written summary after every session. Travel included.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW A SESSION WORKS -->
  <section class="session-steps">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">How a session works</p>
      <h2 class="section-h2">Three steps. Zero disruption.</h2>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <rect x="8" y="6" width="32" height="36" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M16 6V4M32 6V4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M8 18h32" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M16 28h8M16 34h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Book a session</h3>
          <p>Get in touch and we'll lock in a date that fits inside your existing indoor pre-season training night.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="24" cy="16" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M8 40c0-8.837 7.163-16 16-16s16 7.163 16 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M34 30l6-6M40 24l2 2-8 8-2-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>We come to you</h3>
          <p>I arrive at your training venue and work with your fast bowlers in real time during the session. Travel is included.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M12 8h24a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v24a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H12a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V12a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M16 20l6 6 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Bowlers leave with a plan</h3>
          <p>Every bowler gets individual feedback and specific areas to work on. Coaches receive a written summary to reinforce it through pre-season.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO -->
  <section class="who">
    <div class="slash-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container who-inner">
      <p class="section-label light">Who it's for</p>
      <h2 class="who-h2">Any fast bowler who wants to head into the season with a plan.</h2>
      <div class="who-tags">
        <span class="tag">Junior players</span>
        <span class="tag">Senior club players</span>
        <span class="tag">1st &amp; 2nd XI bowlers</span>
        <span class="tag">Emerging quicks</span>
        <span class="tag">Academy program bowlers</span>
      </div>
      <p class="who-note">Sessions are grouped by age and playing standard, so coaching and bowling plans are tailored to the level of cricket each group plays.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING -->
  <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Pricing</p>
      <h2 class="section-h2">Packages shaped around your club.</h2>
      <div class="pricing-contact">
        <p class="pricing-contact-body">Sessions are shaped around your club's program, the number of bowlers in your group, and what you're looking to get out of it. Get in touch and we'll work out what makes sense.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch for details</a>
      </div>
      <p class="pricing-note">Only a small number of clubs can be accommodated this pre-season. Eastern suburbs of Melbourne only.</p>
      <div class="flyer-download">
        <a href="TBL_Flyer.pdf" download class="btn-download">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16">
            <path d="M10 3v10M6 9l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M4 15h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          Download the flyer
        </a>
        <span class="flyer-hint">Share with your committee or coaching staff</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MID PAGE CTA -->
  <section class="mid-cta">
    <div class="container mid-cta-inner">
      <div class="mid-cta-text">
        <h2 class="mid-cta-h2">Ready to give your bowlers a specialist edge?</h2>
        <p class="mid-cta-sub">Pre-season spots are limited. The earlier you lock something in, the more time your bowlers have to apply the work before round one.</p>
      </div>
